Like, he does when anyone else ever is running a meeting.

981
00:41:37.110 --> 00:41:40.250
But one person is going to shine in this meeting, and it's Daryl.

982
00:41:40.370 --> 00:41:44.230
He has an idea about shipment because printers and paper ship differently.

983
00:41:44.570 --> 00:41:44.910
Mm-hmm.

984
