And he shows this to Joe, and she's like, I like this.

985
00:41:47.370 --> 00:41:48.790
You should have an office up here.

986
00:41:49.470 --> 00:41:49.890
Mm-hmm.

987
00:41:49.890 --> 00:41:51.870
And then her dynamic with Gabe is so great.

988
00:41:51.950 --> 00:41:52.650
It's so good.

989
00:41:52.910 --> 00:41:54.590
Gabe was like, I actually put, you know what?

990
00:41:54.590 --> 00:41:55.490
I'm going to pack up my stuff.

991
00:41:55.650 --> 00:41:55.950
No problem.

992
00:41:56.250 --> 00:41:56.650
Exactly.

993
00:41:57.630 --> 00:42:02.990
And this is the moment Michael reveals that he bought tickets to come to Tallahassee.

994
00:42:03.310 --> 00:42:04.950
July 4th weekend.

995
00:42:05.510 --> 00:42:06.490
July 4th weekend.

996
