Michael isn't catching the hint.

1003
00:42:18.550 --> 00:42:20.190
And finally, she's like, enough!

1004
00:42:20.670 --> 00:42:22.530
Jenna, I remember when we filmed that.

1005
00:42:22.630 --> 00:42:22.970
You do?

1006
00:42:23.210 --> 00:42:24.490
You could have heard a pin drop.

1007
00:42:25.330 --> 00:42:26.850
We were all terrified.

1008
00:42:28.190 --> 00:42:30.830
She was so powerful in that moment.

1009
00:42:31.390 --> 00:42:33.330
Like, her acting is so good.

1010
00:42:33.530 --> 00:42:35.430
It literally shut up the whole room.

1011
00:42:35.810 --> 00:42:36.690
I love her.

1012
00:42:37.650 --> 00:42:43.130
And Michael has this line where he says, all right, everybody, just try to put a brave face on.

1013
