It looks like he's about to cry.

1014
00:42:47.110 --> 00:42:50.310
Daryl is moving on up to his new office.

1015
00:42:50.530 --> 00:42:51.090
He's singing.

1016
00:42:51.290 --> 00:42:52.490
The jingle from the Jeffersons.

1017
00:42:53.010 --> 00:42:55.110
Yes, it was written by Janet Dubois.

1018
00:42:55.110 --> 00:43:03.570
Randy negotiated just the sync rights to the song, which meant that Craig could sing them a cappella, but could have no musical accompaniment,

1019
00:43:03.650 --> 00:43:05.490
and we could not play the actual song.

1020
00:43:05.670 --> 00:43:11.830
And it cost us $17,000 for him to sing as he's moving into his new office.

1021
00:43:12.350 --> 00:43:14.130
Michael is confused.

1022
00:43:14.590 --> 00:43:15.550
He's upset.

1023
00:43:15.770 --> 00:43:17.390
He goes in to see Joe.

1024
00:43:18.050 --> 00:43:25.090
I love when he's like, I'll knock once for yes and twice for no, and she said, how many knocks to get you to do some work?

1025
00:43:25.230 --> 00:43:25.790
I know.

1026
00:43:26.270 --> 00:43:27.170
It's so good.

